 "what": "Confirmatory pooled medians, in milliseconds, for every DCU campaign that reached a qualified endpoint, one row per task. Retained so the counts in F-2026-09-18-002 and F-2026-09-18-005 are derived from data rather than restated from a previous sentence: the floor count was asserted in prose twice before it was right, and a second count in the same record -- how many runs rose above the floor -- was wrong as well.",
